    "payloads are bodies of APNs requests with the apns-push-type header liveactivity and the topic <bundle ID>.push-type.liveactivity.",
    "Send start to a push-to-start token, and update and end to the Live Activity's push token.",
    "Dates in attributes and content-state are Unix timestamps in seconds, like aps.timestamp, stale-date and dismissal-date.",
    "Each vector's json decodes to the same value as its canonical form, which is what the SDK writes. A vector without canonical fails to decode."
